Subject: [PATCH 07734/11362] [outer-loop] ARC nav solver: self-correcting
 branch_mode (verify-not-predict) (REQ-ARC-WMTE-5839)

auto_branch_mode's short no-win probe can mispredict (tu93's parity only shows at a
level-win). Fix: solve_navigation now VERIFIES -- try the guessed mode; if the
reproduction gate reproduces fewer levels than the search reached (non-idempotency
signature), retry the other mode and keep the best-reproduced. The gate is ground truth,
so it's robust without a perfect idempotency oracle.

